        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>市场分析</title>\n  <script>\n    window.MathJax = {\n      tex: {\n        inlineMath: [['$', '$'], ['\\\\(', '\\\\)']],\n        displayMath: [['$$', '$$'], ['\\\\[', '\\\\]']]\n      }\n    };\n  </script>\n  <script async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * {\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n\n    html,\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      min-height: 100%;\n    }\n\n    body {\n      background: #861187;\n      color: #333;\n      font-family: \"Noto Serif SC\", \"Songti SC\", SimSun, serif;\n      padding: 15px 13px;\n    }\n\n    .page {\n      width: 100%;\n      max-width: 514px;\n      min-height: 692px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      padding: 22px 12px 30px;\n      background: #fff;\n      border-radius: 27px;\n      overflow: hidden;\n    }\n\n    h1 {\n      margin: 0 0 17px 11px;\n      color: #a5161b;\n      font-family: \"Noto Sans SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n      font-size: 26px;\n      line-height: 1.2;\n      font-weight: 700;\n    }\n\n    .content {\n      font-size: 16px;\n      line-height: 1.78;\n      letter-spacing: 0;\n    }\n\n    p {\n      margin: 0;\n      text-align: left;\n      text-indent: 2em;\n    }\n\n    .chart-wrap {\n      width: 370px;\n      height: 195px;\n      margin: 42px auto 0;\n    }\n\n    .placeholder {\n      position: relative;\n      width: 100%;\n      height: 100%;\n      border: 1px solid #e5e5e5;\n      color: #777;\n      background:\n        linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent 19%, #eeeeee 19%, #eeeeee 20%, transparent 20%,\n        transparent 39%, #eeeeee 39%, #eeeeee 40%, transparent 40%,\n        transparent 59%, #eeeeee 59%, #eeeeee 60%, transparent 60%,\n        transparent 79%, #eeeeee 79%, #eeeeee 80%, transparent 80%),\n        #fff;\n      font-family: \"Noto Serif SC\", \"Songti SC\", SimSun, serif;\n      font-size: 8px;\n      text-align: center;\n    }\n\n    .placeholder-title {\n      padding-top: 5px;\n      font-size: 9px;\n      color: #777;\n    }\n\n    .bars {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 29px;\n      right: 11px;\n      bottom: 28px;\n      height: 119px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: flex-end;\n      justify-content: space-around;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid #bdbdbd;\n    }\n\n    .bar {\n      position: relative;\n      width: 12px;\n      background: #5b9bd5;\n    }\n\n    .bar::before {\n      content: attr(data-value);\n      position: absolute;\n      top: -12px;\n      left: 50%;\n      transform: translateX(-50%);\n      color: #555;\n      font-size: 7px;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n\n    .bar::after {\n      content: \"\";\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 50%;\n      top: 100%;\n      width: 42px;\n      transform: translate(-50%, 5px) rotate(-35deg);\n      transform-origin: top center;\n      border-top: 1px solid transparent;\n    }\n\n    .bar-labels {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 31px;\n      right: 7px;\n      bottom: 8px;\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-around;\n      color: #555;\n      font-size: 6px;\n    }\n\n    .bar-labels span {\n      width: 33px;\n      transform: rotate(-35deg);\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n\n    .placeholder-caption {\n      position: absolute;\n      width: 1px;\n      height: 1px;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      clip: rect(0 0 0 0);\n      clip-path: inset(50%);\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n\n    @media (max-width: 440px) {\n      body {\n        padding: 12px 10px;\n      }\n\n      .page {\n        padding-left: 11px;\n        padding-right: 11px;\n      }\n\n      .content {\n        font-size: 15px;\n        line-height: 1.8;\n      }\n\n      .chart-wrap {\n        width: min(370px, 88vw);\n        height: auto;\n        aspect-ratio: 370 / 195;\n      }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <h1>市场分析</h1>\n\n    <section class=\"content\">\n      <p>随着年轻一代消费理念的改变，国货彩妆在“颜值”与“内涵”方面的双重提升以及社交媒体的推波助澜，国货彩妆在最适合的时机“杀”回了市场，也在越来越多元化的市场中找到了自己的一席之地。在当下的美妆领域，以“少女心”为品牌内核定义的“花知晓”正悄然崛起。95后、00后逐渐成为消费主力军，不以出身论品牌，对国货持欢迎态度，对互联网的粘性更强，成为新国货在新媒体中更容易影响到的目标群体。</p>\n\n      <p>根据智研招讯研究所发布的《2020—2026年中国化妆品行业产销运营现状及发展前景分析报告》数据显示：2022年中国美妆行业市场规模将突破5000亿元，随着人均可支配收入的不断增长，这意味着“美妆”在国内是一块受到资本追捧的大型诱人蛋糕。</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <figure class=\"chart-wrap\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"图表：消费者选择美妆产品所考虑的因素\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder-title\">消费者选择美妆产品所考虑的因素</div>\n        <div class=\"bars\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <i class=\"bar\" style=\"height: 12%;\" data-value=\"12%\"></i>\n          <i class=\"bar\" style=\"height: 14%;\" data-value=\"14%\"></i>\n          <i class=\"bar\" style=\"height: 17%;\" data-value=\"17%\"></i>\n          <i class=\"bar\" style=\"height: 18%;\" data-value=\"18%\"></i>\n          <i class=\"bar\" style=\"height: 34%;\" data-value=\"34%\"></i>\n          <i class=\"bar\" style=\"height: 53%;\" data-value=\"53%\"></i>\n          <i class=\"bar\" style=\"height: 55%;\" data-value=\"55%\"></i>\n          <i class=\"bar\" style=\"height: 62%;\" data-value=\"62%\"></i>\n          <i class=\"bar\" style=\"height: 63%;\" data-value=\"63%\"></i>\n          <i class=\"bar\" style=\"height: 65%;\" data-value=\"65%\"></i>\n          <i class=\"bar\" style=\"height: 71%;\" data-value=\"71%\"></i>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"bar-labels\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <span>产品功效</span>\n          <span>品牌知名度</span>\n          <span>产品价格</span>\n          <span>包装</span>\n          <span>产品成分</span>\n          <span>使用效果</span>\n          <span>安全性</span>\n          <span>口碑</span>\n          <span>促销活动</span>\n          <span>产品类型</span>\n          <span>其他</span>\n        </div>\n        <figcaption class=\"placeholder-caption\">[Chart: centere